              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jess Vriesema"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this without added sugar, and I uses soy milk instead of regular milk. I used two of the red (\"Tommy Atkins\") mangos generally available in US grocery stores, and it was sweet enough. \n\nAdd the cardamom if you have it! It really contributes to the flavor!",
